        "author_association": "NONE",
        "active_lock_reason": null,
        "body": "Hello,\r\nWe are using `focus-rings` on our current project but I have an issue when the focus-ring is on a link within a menu which has a `position: sticky;`.\r\n\r\nThe focus ring will move while I'm scrolling down.\r\n\r\nI get the fact that the `FocusRingScope` is moving while I scroll but how could I use a different scope for elements within sticky positioned elements ?\r\n\r\nThank you for you help.",
