        "closed_at": null,
        "author_association": "NONE",
        "active_lock_reason": null,
        "body": "I've forked the hosted example and changed the scrollable area to have a black background. I've also changed the `--focus-primary` var to black.\r\nhttps://codesandbox.io/s/bold-sun-lx1im?file=/public/index.html\r\n\r\nThe focus ring should be adapting and showing a visible focus ring in this case right? At the moment it's still just creating a black focus ring. ",
